      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood's tight‑knit community still celebrates the Mummers tradition, with a museum at 1100 South 2nd Street showcasing costumes and memorabilia.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
